    "detailed_description": "This 2D game is about a seahorse and what it\u2019s like to be one for a day! The protagonist must go through a series of challenges until finding its mate, each being totally different. The game also features real information about marine life along with light humor to make everything more fun. Could you be a seahorse? Find out with Ziggy. In this underwater adventure, which consists of a sort of obstacle race to reach the protagonist\u2019s main goal, you will discover more about the life of a seahorse!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was made aiming to be for all ages and to present an educational character. Please, enjoy!",
    "about_the_game": "This 2D game is about a seahorse and what it\u2019s like to be one for a day! The protagonist must go through a series of challenges until finding its mate, each being totally different. The game also features real information about marine life along with light humor to make everything more fun. Could you be a seahorse? Find out with Ziggy. In this underwater adventure, which consists of a sort of obstacle race to reach the protagonist\u2019s main goal, you will discover more about the life of a seahorse!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was made aiming to be for all ages and to present an educational character. Please, enjoy!",
    "short_description": "Survive with Ziggy through the challenges of a carioca marine life in search of its ideal mate. Take the opportunity to learn more about the life of a seahorse and its daily challenges, as well as predators and prey!",
